('retiree_scam_digital_arrest', 'A video caller in uniform says your Aadhaar is linked to a crime, you''re under "digital arrest", and you must transfer money to clear your name. What should you do?', 'SINGLE', '{"A":"Pay quickly and quietly to avoid trouble","B":"Hang up: no police or agency arrests anyone over a video call or asks for money — report it on 1930 or cybercrime.gov.in","C":"Share your bank OTP so they can verify your account","D":"Stay on the call and ask a family member to send the money"}'::jsonb, 'SAVING', ARRAY['RETIREE'], 1, '{"correct":"B","points":10}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, 170, 'spotting "digital arrest" scams', 'Digital arrest scam'),
